sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Frontend
    participant Auth
    participant Agent as admin-service
    participant Graph as LangGraph
    participant Read as Inspection

    Admin->>UI: Demander une inspection
    UI->>Auth: Verifier la session
    Auth-->>UI: Session valide
    UI->>Agent: Transmettre la demande
    Agent->>Graph: Classifier l'intention
    Graph->>Read: Interroger l'etat du systeme
    Read-->>Graph: Informations d'inspection
    opt Consultation des parametres RAG en lecture seule
        Graph->>Read: Lire les parametres RAG
        Read-->>Graph: Parametres actuels
    end
    Graph-->>UI: Retourner la synthese
    UI-->>Admin: Afficher l'inspection
